  "public_messages": [
    "I’ll read the task guidance and source-room instructions, collect the frozen evidence, then build and cross-check the calculations and deliverables. I’m using the installed OpenSocrates controller as requested.",
    "The source room is downloaded. Its accounting rules require resolving revisions across both order pages and the correction file before applying eligibility filters, then attaching returns only to eligible shipments. I’ll audit those edge cases and use the saved ECB and World Bank snapshots for the core model.",
    "The reconciled 2025 base is 1,254 eligible shipped orders and €2.03m contribution. Czechia plus Spain leads the client’s base scenario at €198,099 incremental annual contribution, but the defined joint stress cuts that pair to €32,180; Netherlands plus Spain leads under stress. I’ll make that trade-off and a second-hub decision gate explicit in the board materials.",
